2. The E8 Voronoi code against the scalar rule at equal bits (issue #3)
   KL gain is 10 log10 of the scalar rule's mean KL over E8's. The gap is the scalar rule's mean KL less E8's, and its error is the root of the
   sum of the squares of the two standard errors. Holds: lower by 2 errors and at least half the gemma KL gain. Shrinks: lower by 2 errors, less than half.
